	(gr_text "If you can read this, you're holding the wrong side. \nHello, debugger! You've just uncovered the heart of a \ncreation built from curiosity, late nights, and \ncountless lines of code. May your voltages stay stable,\nyour traces short, and your circuits ever faithful. \nIn copper we trust - because every connection tells a \nstory, and every spark begins with an idea."
